{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00440","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后明堂乐章 角音 · 武则天","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后明堂乐章 角音","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出震位，开平秩。\n扇条风，乘甲乙。\n龙德盛，鸟星出。\n荐珪篚，陈诚实。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武则天","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00440.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00440","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}